save_HTTK_BONDS

    _definition.id                HTTK_BONDS
    _definition.scope             Category
    _definition.class             Set
    _definition.update            2026-11-14
    _description.text
;
    Items describing the bond network listed in the _geom_bond_ loop of the
    same data block: whether a network without bonds is known, and who
    assigned the bonds. Each _geom_bond_ row stands for its whole bond orbit
    under the operations of the block.
;
    _name.category_id             CIF_HTTK_HEAD
    _name.object_id               HTTK_BONDS

save_

save_httk_bonds.count

    _definition.id                '_httk_bonds.count'
    _alias.definition_id          '_httk_bonds_count'
    _definition.update            2026-11-14
    _description.text
;
    The number of rows of the _geom_bond_ loop. Since a CIF loop cannot have
    zero rows, the value 0 without a _geom_bond_ loop states that the
    structure is known to have no bonds, while a block with neither states
    nothing about bonds. httk writes only the value 0; a reader that finds a
    value that disagrees with the loop keeps the loop.
;
    _name.category_id             httk_bonds
    _name.object_id               count
    _type.purpose                 Number
    _type.source                  Derived
    _type.container               Single
    _type.contents                Integer
    _enumeration.range            0:
    _units.code                   none

save_

save_httk_bonds.source_description

    _definition.id                '_httk_bonds.source_description'
    _alias.definition_id          '_httk_bonds_source_description'
    _definition.update            2026-11-14
    _description.text
;
    Free text naming who or what assigned the bonds of the _geom_bond_ loop,
    for example the rule used. Unknown is '?'. The items are written only
    when the source is known in part; all four are then given.
;
    _name.category_id             httk_bonds
    _name.object_id               source_description
    _type.purpose                 Audit
    _type.source                  Assigned
    _type.container               Single
    _type.contents                Text

save_

